{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/TrenWishlist616.gif?t=1749293771\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/AllAboardTitle616.png?t=1749293771\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/RobShayLeanderViz616Anim.gif?t=1749293771\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the crew of Railpunk Mayhem, destroy enemies in your path using your train's tools and complete the journey as quickly as possible.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/GameplayGifFrame616.gif?t=1749293771\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/BuildYourTrainTitle616.png?t=1749293771\" /></div>Choose from a multitude of wagons, each with upgrade branches and unique features that will aid you on your journey. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/WagonsSelect616.gif?t=1749293771\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/RecruitYourCrewTitle616.png?t=1749293771\" /></div>Come across a variety of mercenaries throughout your journey, each one ready to join your crew. Every crew member brings their own set of unique strengths, adding diversity to your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/CrewGif616.gif?t=1749293771\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/CollectArtifacts.png?t=1749293771\" /></div>Seek out artifacts\u2014powerful upgrades that will enhance your crew and your train.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/ArtifactsGifUI616.gif?t=1749293771\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/PlanYourRouteTitle616.png?t=1749293771\" /></div>Carefully choose your path\u2014the cities you visit will provide assistance that can make a significant difference. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/LevelSelectionFrame616.gif?t=1749293771\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2874350?t=1749293771","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2874350?t=1749293771","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749293771","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749293771","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragra